bip39-english.txt is the English word list of BIP 39, "Mnemonic code for
generating deterministic keys", copied unchanged from
https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039/english.txt
(SHA-256 2f5eed53a4727b4bf8880d8f3f199efc90e58503646d9ff8eff3a2ed3b24dbda).
Publisher uses it only to make export passphrases. BIP 39 states: "This
BIP falls under the MIT License."

